# Virtual Environment
# No trailing slash: a worktree shares the main checkout's env by SYMLINKING it
# (playwright.config.ts resolves ../.venv relative to the worktree), and `.venv/`
# matches directories only — so the symlink showed up as untracked and a
# `git add -A` would commit it. CLAUDE.md tells everyone to use worktrees, so
# this is the normal case, not an edge one.
.venv
venv
ENV/
env/

tmpclaude*

